---
Title: Teriyaki Sauce
Servings: 1 cup
Tags: Prospects, Japanese, Sauce, Mirin, Soy Sauce
Link: https://www.justonecookbook.com/teriyaki-sauce/
---

In a #saucepan{}, add @Sake{1/2 cup} and @Mirin{1/2 cup}.

Add @Soy Sauce{1/2 cup} and @Sugar{1/4 cup}.

Bring the mixture to a boil over medium heat and continuously stir the sauce until the sugar is dissolved.

Once boiling, lower the heat to medium-low and simmer for ~{10-15 minutes} or until the sauce is thickened and small bubbles start to rise and appear on the surface.

Pour the sauce into a #sterilized jar{} and leave uncovered to cool.